****************************************************************  8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
 The resolved resonance evaluation utilized transmission and      8231 1451
 capture data sets [ref01-03] in the SAMMY code [ref04]. Datasets 8231 1451
 by Borella and Domingo-Pardo were used to constrain the          8231 1451
 radiation widths of resonance and add additional minor capture   8231 1451
 resonance which did not appear in previous evaluations.          8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
 Base resonance parameters taken from ENDF/B-VIII [ref05].        8231 1451
 The effective scattering radius R' was set to 9.70 fm to         8231 1451
 get proper potential scattering term [ref06].                    8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
 -------------------------------------------------------------    8231 1451
 Cross Section(2200 m/s)  RPI (b)             NIST (b)            8231 1451
 total                     10.88            10.68 +/- 0.11        8231 1451
 elastic                   10.86            10.68 +/- 0.11        8231 1451
 capture                   0.026            0.028 +/- 0.008       8231 1451
 -------------------------------------------------------------    8231 1451
 Resonance Integral              RPI (b)                          8231 1451
 total                      1.30768E+02                           8231 1451
 elastic                    1.30682E+02                           8231 1451
 capture                    8.66660E-02                           8231 1451
 -------------------------------------------------------------    8231 1451
 Scattering Length         RPI(fm)            NIST (fm)           8231 1451
 bound coherent            9.24             9.22 +/- 0.05         8231 1451
 -------------------------------------------------------------    8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
 MF-4 was recalculated from resonance parameters on a high        8231 1451
 resolution energy grid within the RRR limits using NJOY16[ref07] 8231 1451
 with Blatt-Biedenharn formalism enabed.                          8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
 MF-32 was produced with SAMMY with CSWEG 239 group structure in  8231 1451
 mind. Scattering radius uncertainty included.                    8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
 MF-33 calculated with CoH and KALMAN filter, specifically        8231 1451
 MT-1,2,3,4,16,102.                                               8231 1451
****************************************************************  8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
Fast Region Evaluation: 0.9  to 20 MeV                            8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
   P. Brain*, Y.Danon*, D.Brown", T.Kawano&, A.Lewis^,            8231 1451
   and D. Barry^                                                  8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
  *Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute                               8231 1451
