  "Brookhaven National Laboratory                                 8231 1451
     Upton, NY 11973-5000, USA                                    8231 1451
  ^Naval Nuclear Laboratory                                       8231 1451
     Schenectady, New York 12301-1072, USA                        8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
****************************************************************  8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
 Full calculation of all reaction channels from threshold to 20   8231 1451
 MeV using CoH-3 Hauser Feschbach Statistical Code [ref08].       8231 1451
 Koning global fit OMP parameters adjusted to fit experimental    8231 1451
 data [ref09] - [ref14]. Coupled channels and DWBA used for       8231 1451
 inelastic channels with a vibrational deformation model.         8231 1451
 Resonance structure that could not be resolved but is present    8231 1451
 in transmission data sets were included to elastic and inelastic 8231 1451
 partial channels such that the total calculated cross section    8231 1451
 matches the experimental. Angular distributions for all          8231 1451
 reactions were calculated from CoH-3.                            8231 1451
                                                                  8231 1451
